File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: Make progress faster or slower,  Next: Change what a lookup does,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.1 Make progress faster or slower
==================================

     (setq bltzread-promotion-thresholds '(2 2 3 4))
   The four numbers are clean reads needed to leave level 1, 2, 3 and 4.


File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: Change what a lookup does,  Next: Turn off single-key shortcuts,  Prev: Make progress faster or slower,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.2 Change what a lookup does
=============================

     (setq bltzread-lookup-effect 'demote)
   A word you look up now also goes down one level.


File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: Turn off single-key shortcuts,  Next: Colours,  Prev: Change what a lookup does,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.3 Turn off single-key shortcuts
=================================

If the digit keys clash with another mode:
     (setq bltzread-direct-keys nil)
   You still have ‘s 3’ and the rest.  The prefix is
‘bltzread-prefix-key’ (default ‘s’).


File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: Colours,  Next: Dictionaries,  Prev: Turn off single-key shortcuts,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.4 Colours
===========

Run ‘M-x customize-face RET bltzread-level-1 RET’.  Change the
background.  Do the same for the others.


File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: Dictionaries,  Next: The pasted-text page,  Prev: Colours,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.5 Dictionaries
================

Tell bltzread where your StarDict folders are, and which to use for each
language:
     (setq bltzread-sdcv-data-dir "~/archive/_goldendict")
     (setq bltzread-sdcv-dictionaries
           '(("slv" "DSSJ-E-sl-en")
             ("pli" "dpd")))
   A name may be the exact one shown by ‘sdcv -l -2
~/archive/_goldendict’, the folder name, or a unique part of the name.
Inside ‘use-package :custom’ write each pair as
‘(bltzread-sdcv-dictionaries '(...))’, not ‘(setq ...)’.  Languages not
listed search no dictionary.  If lookups return nothing, run ‘M-x
bltzread-dict-diagnose’.


File: bltzread-tutorial.info,  Node: The pasted-text page,  Prev: Dictionaries,  Up: Part 4 Basic configuration

5.6 The pasted-text page
========================

     (setq bltzread-paste-font-family "Georgia"
           bltzread-paste-font-height 1.5
           bltzread-paste-line-spacing 0.5
           bltzread-paste-margin 12)


